flowchart TD
 U[Trusted User / IdP] --> I[Identity + Tenant]
 I --> P[Untrusted Planner / LLM / Specialists]
 P --> G[Input + Provenance Guard]
 G --> E[Canonical Action Envelope\nExact parameters + digests]
 E --> PEP[Policy Enforcement Point]
 PEP --> PDP[Deterministic PDP\nIssuer • Signature • Tenant • Scope\nSoD • Expiry • Budget • Nonce]
 PDP --> D{Decision}
 D -->|DENY / STOP| A[Safe Stop + Audit]
 D -->|APPROVAL| H[Independent Reviewer\nExact action digest]
 H --> PDP
 D -->|ALLOW| L[Atomic single-use capability lease]
 L --> F[Final Interlock + Audit Admission]
 F -->|FAIL| A
 F -->|PASS| X[Credential-isolated Execution Gateway]
 X --> S[Sandbox + Filesystem Policy + Egress Proxy]
 S --> T[Allowlisted External Sink / Synthetic Fixture]
 T --> R[Result Validation + Size Limits]
 R --> Z[Append-only Evidence Ledger]
 Z --> O[Observability / SIEM]
